{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42929","headline":"竹 · 韩溉","name":"竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"树色连云万叶开，王孙不厌满庭栽。\n凌霜尽节无人见，终日虚心待凤来。\n谁许风流添兴咏，自怜潇洒出尘埃。\n朱门处处多闲地，正好移阴覆翠苔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩溉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}